    "Open for Keel/Splice via Aster: the expander must aim a guard's regular tie at the café staff on shift at the pre-shift stop. Done-check: a share of guards hold it. Resubmit when the requirement line reads met.",
    "No clerk routine stops at the café, so clerks are not claimed as café regulars; only guards carry preShift cafe.",
    "Question for Motive: does a need entry with `positions` leave other positions undrawn by it? I assumed yes and listed keeper on the other entries.",
    "Café servers draw debt (100, server only); official drivers draw cash (100, driver only). All four temperaments can be met on those needs.",
    "Official-driver 8, guard 15, councillor 15, clerk 62 of 72: each gets at least one person. Server 60 of the café staff stands at the door.",
    "Starting values [S]: all weights, shares and leave-before ranges are mine, to tune by playtest. Names: 72 given, 96 family, 12 origins, none over 9% of a pool."
